# ticket-wait-reason: why the ticket waits.
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>meaning
decision	-	a choice is needed
blocker	-	something is in the way
dependency	-	another ticket must end first
quota	-	an account, a model or a slot is used up
ci	-	a hosted check runs
approval	-	a yes to merge or land
review	-	a review finding or a critic round
parked	-	set aside by the lead
date	-	held to a date
